<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Inmins ups half year EPS, no div.</title>
<headline>Inmins ups half year EPS, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  5.7	   vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.51	  vs 0.80</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.36	  vs 2.28</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.16	  vs 0.54</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.45	  vs 0.22</p>
<p>    Turnover		  106.07	vs 90.76</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     0.09	  vs nil</p>
<p>Full name: Inmins Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said no interim dividend had been declared. Shareholders were directed to a cautionary dated June 13 concerning talks with outside shareholders. Directors said that if talks were successful attributable profit would have increased by 684,000 rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
